{"id":"vera","lemma":"вера","pos":"noun","rank":1419,"glosses":["belief, faith","trust, faith (belief in someone's honesty and reliability)","faith, creed (adherence to a religion; a set of religious beliefs)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b2/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"веры","plural":"веры"},"examples":[{"text":"Моя вера сильна.","en":"My belief is strong.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,null]},{"text":"Наша вера очень сильна.","en":"Our faith is very strong.","words":[{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},null,{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Вера может сдвинуть горы.","en":"Faith can move mountains.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283212","words":[null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to shift, to move"},{"g":"mountain","l":"гора"}]},{"text":"Моя вера в тебя никогда не ослабевала.","en":"My faith in you has never wavered.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"мой"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Её вера в Бога непоколебима.","en":"Her belief in God is unshaken.","words":[{"g":"her"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"God","l":"бог"},null]}]}